			            IF ( Delta >= 0, UNICHAR ( 9650 ), UNICHAR ( 9660 ) ) & " " & FORMAT ( Delta, "+0.0%;-0.0%;0.0%" ) & " vs prior year (" & FORMAT ( PrevValue / 1000, "#,0.0" ) & "K" & ")"
			        )
			    )
			```
		displayFolder: 3. KPI labels
		lineageTag: eb7d8ed3-8c8c-5710-899f-f93d78c6bbb0

